.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Hold native memory for exchange between PDG APIs\&. 


.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
\fBAPI Stability: 2 — Evolving\fP\&. This API is implemented and supported, but its contract is still settling\&. Compatibility is preserved where practical; breaking changes are documented in release notes\&. See \fBAPI stability\fP\&.
.RE
.PP
A \fBMemBlock\fP is either an owned block or a borrowed view of another native object's storage\&. \fBSerializer\&.getDataPtr()\fP returns a borrowed block: keep the serializer alive and do not modify or clear it while using that block\&.

.PP
\fBgetData()\fP and \fBgetBytes()\fP return independent Uint8Array copies\&. Use those snapshots when the data must outlive its native owner\&. See \fBgetData()\fP for Node\&.js Buffer conversion and the copy cost of each conversion form\&. 
